      "created_at": "2015-03-12T17:16:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What I'm trying to say is that last night Rabit was playing Omnitron and Unity, put out Turret Bot to create a bunch of hazard spaces, and then used Omnitron's push power (Interpolation Beam?) to move Proletariat, Proletariat, Proletariat, Dawn, and Citizen Autumn through a bunch of hazard spaces. It was pretty awesome.</p>",
